  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpaceGame.Gameplay.DialogInteraction
  dialogMode: 2
  dialogLines:
  - Good to see another suit out here.
  - Check your seals before you head past the domes.
  - The colony's small, but the air in here is ours.
  predefinedRandomPool:
  - Scrubbers are running hot again.
  - Dock pod's been quiet since the last supply drop.
  - Don't trust the dunes after dark.
  - Hab row's full. You'll have to bunk in the hub.
  - Somebody keeps tracking sand through the airlock.
  - If you find spare filters, bring them back.
